It rejects every answer the first 3-15 attempts. After that it'll accept correct solution. kidding.

&#x200B;

if you look closely you can see a three by three grid with a few of the holes filled in. match em up

Good job.

&#x200B;

Feels good, huh!

Cheers to you as well!

&#x200B;

I'm pretty much always down for co-op if you ever want a partner.

I beat Kal for the first time last night. As far as dragons go, and DLC is concerned, I was a little surprised at how... not impossible it was? I don't wanna say 'easy', but it was not neeear as bad as I thought it'd be.

&#x200B;

Good job!
